{ dg-modules "genietransput" }
{ Rosetta Code, task "Non-decimal radices/Output", ALGOL 68 solution non-decimal-radices-output.alg.
  https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Non-decimal_radices/Output#ALGOL_68
  The text of Rosetta Code is available under the GNU Free Documentation
  License 1.3 (see README.md).  The solution is unchanged in orig/non-decimal-radices-output.a68;
  this copy was prepared for ga68 and converted to SUPPER stropping by
  tools/rosetta_prep.py. }
access Genie_Transput (
main:(
  for i to 33 do
    printf(($10r6d," "16r6d," "8r6dl$, BIN i, BIN i, BIN i))
  od
)
)
